            "review_title": "Review at Kemuri Donburi",
            "review_text": "TuiTeka\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam55 contributions\n0\nJust like Tokyo\nJul 2019 • Solo\nIncredibly delicious and brought so many memories back from living in Tokyo\n\nEverything thing is meticulously prepared and incredibly reasonably priced - you can also enjoy outside with superb free ice tea or inside the teahouse with air conditioning\n\nThis is a hidden gem in Saigon and a highly recommended visit - just drive into the courtyard at #135 and you'll see it nestled in the corner with upmarket restaurant grade fitout in this lovely little hole in the wall serving incredible Japanese cuisine\nRead more\nWritten July 1, 2019",
